  "tandemSoGehts": [
    "Cut the cards in the middle. Partner A takes the left half, Partner B takes the right half.",
    "A builds question 1 from the tiles and asks it: “¿Qué hacías los domingos en tu país?” (You make the imperfecto.)",
    "B hears the question and builds the answer with the imperfecto: -ar verbs take -aba (trabajaba), -er and -ir verbs take -ía (comía, salía). Only three verbs are irregular: ser (era), ir (iba), ver (veía). Yo and él have the same form: vivía. A tile in brackets like (yo) says who is speaking: it is not written.",
    "Then B asks question 2 and A answers. Take turns. At the end, check with the answer sheet.",
    "Last, swap cards and do it all again, faster."
  ],
  "tandemRedemittel": [
